00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Hi, in this video we're going to cover how to configure database backups if you're using the bundled H2 database.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
If you use an external database, your database administrator manages your backup settings outside of BurpSuite Enterprise.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
First of all, log in to your Enterprise server. Click on the cog to bring up the settings menu and select database backup.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
If you don't want to use the default directory, you can edit the location of backups field.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000
To change the number of backups you want to keep, edit the number of backups to store field.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
You can also set how often you want the backups to repeat.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000
If you want to perform a one-off backup, you can click on backup now.

